{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012860","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，就算是你这样的战士，瞄准时也会有晃动吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":"AUX_AIM_WOBBLE_NUANCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"『气力』充足时还好，一旦疲劳，手就难免会抖。尤其是使用又大又重的武器时。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"当然，比起站着，蹲下会更容易瞄准。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"至于用瞄准镜观察的武器，只要稳在一个位置不动，瞄准就会逐渐变得更精确。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"不过，只要继续在Mother Base研发枪械，也许同一系列里会出现瞄准晃动更小的型号。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"如果你很在意瞄准晃动，也可以重点往这个方向研发。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我会记住。不过枪这东西，用久了自然会顺手。老是换来换去，也未必是什么好事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""}]}